~ sighting

Long-range sensors flag a debris cluster tumbling past the station - what is left of an old freighter break-up. Hull plating and raw ore, free to whoever bothers to grab it.

- Mark it for collection
	$> station.salvage("steel", 15, 30, 2)
	$> station.salvage("iron_ore", 10, 25, 1)
	Crew suit up and start hauling debris in through the airlocks.
	=> END
- Let it drift
	Nobody is pulled off shift. The cluster tumbles on into the dark.
	=> END
